  "description": "Fuaran.Core.OpStream.Dag — a content-addressed branching/merging op-DAG over the same StreamWitness as the linear Fuaran.Core.OpStream: append/fork onto any node, merge two heads into a convergent node, verifyDag (parent-link integrity), and deterministic replay-to-head over a topological order. The linear op-stream is untouched (linear consumers take no new dependency). FSharp.Core only, Fable-clean.",
